<view class="cart-page theme-{{currentPersona}}">
<!-- 分层心愿篮 -->
<block wx:if="{{cartGroupData.isNotEmpty}}">
  <cart-group
    store-goods="{{ cartGroupData.storeGoods }}"
    invalid-good-items="{{ cartGroupData.invalidGoodItems }}"
    theme="{{currentPersona}}"
    bindselectgoods="onGoodsSelect"
    bindselectstore="onStoreSelect"
    bindchangequantity="onQuantityChange"
    bindgocollect="goCollect"
    bindgoodsclick="goGoodsDetail"
    bindclearinvalidgoods="clearInvalidGoods"
    binddelete="onGoodsDelete"
    bindcontinuebrowse="onContinueBrowse"
  />

  <view class="gap" />
  <!-- 心愿小计以及发送按钮 -->
  <cart-bar
    is-all-selected="{{cartGroupData.isAllSelected}}"
    total-amount="{{cartGroupData.totalAmount}}"
    total-goods-num="{{cartGroupData.selectedGoodsCount}}"
    total-discount-amount="{{cartGroupData.totalDiscountAmount}}"
    fixed="{{true}}"
    bottomHeight="{{110}}"
    theme="{{currentPersona}}"
    currency="{{currentPersona === 'baby' ? '♡' : '¥'}}"
    send-text="{{personaUi.sendText}}"
    bindhandleSelectAll="onSelectAll"
    bindhandleToSettle="onToSettle"
  />
</block>
<!-- 心愿篮空态 -->
<cart-empty
  wx:else
  theme="{{currentPersona}}"
  img-url="{{currentPersona === 'teacher' ? '/assets/teacher/night-talk-card.jpg' : (currentPersona === 'baby' ? '/assets/baby-thumbnails/now-hug.jpg' : (currentPersona === 'princess' ? '/assets/princess/princess-avatar.jpg' : 'https://tdesign.gtimg.com/miniprogram/template/retail/template/empty-cart.png'))}}"
  tip="{{personaUi.basketName}}还是空的"
  btn-text="{{currentPersona === 'teacher' ? '去看看姐姐指令' : (currentPersona === 'baby' ? '去选一个想要' : (currentPersona === 'princess' ? '去看看公主想要的' : '去写心愿'))}}"
  bind:handleClick="onGotoHome"
/>
</view>
<t-toast id="t-toast" />
<t-dialog id="t-dialog" />
